      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While not a fix a workaround until it get fixed for this is to have a separate shortcut for each user with a different profile in the launch options (--profile=X) so that rather than logging out you just shut down vrchat and then the other player uses their shortcut to start the game since each profile stores its login details.\nThough this is only a good option if you trust the other person with the ability to log in as you.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
