      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b8892d4c1980d2f0f88e639|full_name}: just pick a number instead of X. The default is 0. So if you make one shortcut with --profile=1 at the end of the target path and another with --profile=2 at the end if will remember the different login details each uses. e.g C:\\SteamLibrary\\SteamApps\\common\\VRChat\\VRChat.exe --profile=1",
