  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There is a bug where one person will be using VRChat, log out, another person will log in on the same PC...and the Social tab will still reflect the first person's friends list and favorites. So the other person cannot see their friends when they log in. It's been like this for a long time, but never been fixed.",
